# Regression vectors for the fixes in REVIEW.md (expected output per the alarm.c contract).
### a4-direct-high-to-low
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=0 escalate=0
init 0
s 1 35
s 2 5
---
cfg
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@1:35.000
LOW TO_LOW@2:5.000
